---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Legal title="Accessibility Statement" path="/accessibility">
  <p>
    IV Salt Rejuvenation is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for people with disabilities. We are
    continually improving the user experience for everyone and applying the relevant accessibility standards.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
  <p>
    We aim to conform to the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA and to make our website
    usable for the widest possible audience, in the spirit of the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA).
  </p>

  <h2>Measures We Take</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic, structured HTML with clear headings and landmarks.</li>
    <li>Keyboard-navigable menus, forms, and our booking flow, with visible focus indicators.</li>
    <li>A "skip to content" link for screen reader and keyboard users.</li>
    <li>Descriptive text alternatives for meaningful images.</li>
    <li>Color combinations chosen for readable contrast.</li>
    <li>Respect for the "reduce motion" setting — animations are minimized when you prefer reduced motion.</li>
    <li>Responsive layouts that work across phones, tablets, and desktops.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Ongoing Effort</h2>
  <p>
    Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We regularly review our website and welcome your feedback to help us
    improve.
  </p>

  <h2>Need Help or Found a Barrier?</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter any difficulty using our website, or if you need this information in an alternative format,
    please contact us — we're happy to help and to assist you with booking directly:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Phone or text: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></li>
    <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>We aim to respond to accessibility feedback within a reasonable timeframe.</p>
</Legal>
